{
  "scenario_id": 6,
  "scenario_title": "餐厅选择",
  "metadata": {
    "target_group": "Z世代",
    "intent_l1": "分析规划与建议",
    "intent_l2": "计划制定",
    "task_labels": [
      "策略规划",
      "知识问答",
      "信息检索"
    ]
  },
  "script": [
    {
      "turn_id": "01",
      "event_type": "user_speech",
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "target": "Bob",
      "action_type": "speak",
      "text": "咱难得见个面，走，找个餐厅吃个晚饭去？"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "02",
      "event_type": "user_speech",
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "target": "Alice",
      "action_type": "speak",
      "text": "好呀。你想吃什么？"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "03",
      "event_type": "user_speech",
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "target": "Bob",
      "action_type": "speak",
      "text": "我比较喜欢吃海鲜，你看要不我们去个日料店吃？我知道一家挺不错的店铺。"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "04",
      "event_type": "user_speech",
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "target": "Alice",
      "action_type": "speak",
      "text": "日料恐怕不太行。我吃生的肠胃受不了。煮熟的海鲜倒是可以，你考不考虑吃海鲜火锅呢？"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "05",
      "event_type": "user_speech",
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "target": "AI",
      "action_type": "query",
      "text": "我昨天刚吃了火锅，不是很想再吃啊。算了，我问下AI有什么建议不？"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "06",
      "event_type": "ai_response",
      "speaker": "AI",
      "target": "Alice",
      "action_type": "direct_answer",
      "text": "现在的情况是Alice想吃海鲜但不是很想吃火锅，Bob能吃海鲜但需要保证煮熟。我建议你们去找一家蒸汽海鲜吃，这样能吃到煮熟的海鲜，也不会像火锅那样太腻。"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "07",
      "event_type": "user_speech",
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "target": "Alice",
      "action_type": "speak",
      "text": "好主意啊，我觉得蒸汽海鲜不错，你觉得怎么样"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "08",
      "event_type": "user_speech",
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "target": "Bob",
      "action_type": "speak",
      "text": "我觉得没问题。那咱们现在研究一下去哪一家吧。我不太想走太远，离咱们现在这个位置 南京路步行街500米以内的吧"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "08",
      "event_type": "ai_background",
      "speaker": "AI",
      "target": null,
      "action_type": "action_execution",
      "text": "开始查找：距离南京路步行街查找500米内的整齐海鲜餐厅。"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "09",
      "event_type": "user_speech",
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "target": "Alice",
      "action_type": "speak",
      "text": "嗯，我看AI在后台已经帮我们找到店铺了，我们走吧"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "10",
      "event_type": "user_speech",
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "target": "Bob",
      "action_type": "speak",
      "text": "好的，没问题。"
    }
  ]
}